{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We combined deckbuilding and spacial puzzles to create The Lightning Struck Orphan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is Tetris/Patchwork meets Slay the Spire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a powerful deck of spells and go on a pilgrimage through the gothic city of Akastel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each spell takes up space on your board, forcing you to optimize and make difficult decisions on what to place and in what order.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll feel creative, smart, and occasionally very powerful when you unleash devastating combos on the creatures of Akastel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626660/extras/12.png?t=1744090428\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80+ Spells to combine in creative ways, making for an large variety of unique decks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">28 Unique combat encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn, pray, fight, choose between branching paths, meet haunting characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626660/extras/12.png?t=1744090428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handmade by the Blackthorn Brothers, Noa &amp; Liam Calice. With music by Ellen Senior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626660/extras/3.png?t=1744090428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2626660?t=1744090428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st